## {#mathematically data-menu-title="Mathematically"}

[Mathematically...]{.slide-title}

<hr>

<br>

::: {.body-text-l}
- Nothing > burrito: TRUE

<br>

- Loaf of bread > nothing: TRUE

<br>

To a computer: Loaf of bread > nothing > burrito.
:::

